WEBVTT

01:13.820 --> 01:18.140
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.500 --> 01:23.700
[Episode 24]

01:26.137 --> 01:28.937
[Youfeng Yard]

02:09.137 --> 02:10.737
Eat it yourself.

02:14.337 --> 02:16.657
The tenants clean this place up themselves?

02:19.337 --> 02:22.137
Aunt Gui is in charge
of the communal area.

02:23.777 --> 02:25.337
It's quite comfy and quiet here.

02:30.497 --> 02:33.377
I was standing outside your room

02:33.937 --> 02:34.937
and I saw Xie Zhiyao.

02:36.057 --> 02:37.137
He lives next door.

02:40.697 --> 02:42.137
I asked him yesterday

02:42.417 --> 02:44.576
and he told me he had worked
in Beijing for many years

02:44.577 --> 02:45.617
in the investment industry.

02:46.737 --> 02:49.536
He stayed and worked in
Beijing after finishing university.

02:49.537 --> 02:50.737
Some time ago,

02:51.017 --> 02:52.177
it was the anniversary of his grandpa's death,

02:52.977 --> 02:54.136
and his father came back.

02:54.137 --> 02:55.977
And I met him once.

02:56.657 --> 02:58.297
According to his dad,

02:58.817 --> 03:00.256
his family actually

03:00.257 --> 03:01.977
isn't very supportive of him coming back.

03:02.457 --> 03:06.377
After all, in their minds,
children from the countryside

03:06.977 --> 03:08.377
won't be willing to come back

03:08.937 --> 03:10.057
until they're no longer able to carry on.

03:12.377 --> 03:14.176
I walked around the village,

03:14.177 --> 03:16.817
and didn't see many tourists here.

03:18.457 --> 03:19.977
We'll see in a couple of years.

03:20.857 --> 03:23.256
When this place gains publicity and reputation,

03:23.257 --> 03:24.776
and the Shaohua Bookstore is built,

03:24.777 --> 03:26.256
things will be different.

03:26.257 --> 03:27.336
That's not necessarily true.

03:27.337 --> 03:30.017
A lot of good places
don't have visitors.

03:30.497 --> 03:31.977
There is this possibility.

03:32.617 --> 03:34.377
But I believe the village can get better.

03:35.257 --> 03:37.057
Actually, it's been hard for Xie Zhiyao.

03:37.377 --> 03:38.377
Look.

03:38.577 --> 03:40.136
Everyone in the village goes to him

03:40.137 --> 03:41.697
whenever they have troubles.

03:42.137 --> 03:44.897
But for his own business,
he has to deal with it himself.

03:45.537 --> 03:47.217
But he's always cheerful.

03:47.457 --> 03:48.657
And he never complains.

03:49.537 --> 03:51.457
People will think he has an easy life.

03:55.937 --> 03:56.937
What?

03:57.337 --> 04:00.816
Look how hard he works
and lives his own life.

04:00.817 --> 04:01.897
What about you?

04:02.337 --> 04:03.697
When are you looking for a new job?

04:04.097 --> 04:05.457
I'll wait for one more month, maybe.

04:05.897 --> 04:08.696
Wait until I go home and
help our parents move,

04:08.697 --> 04:10.497
then I'll go find a job.

04:10.857 --> 04:11.897
You still want to go back to Beijing?

04:13.577 --> 04:14.817
Won't you consider coming to Shanghai?

04:15.217 --> 04:16.216
I thought about it.

04:16.217 --> 04:17.257
But I still want to live in Beijing.

04:19.737 --> 04:22.536
Actually,
I think Shanghai has its advantages.

04:22.537 --> 04:25.617
Five-star hotels are
everywhere in Huangpu District.

04:26.457 --> 04:29.056
And your brother-in-law
has an old apartment there.

04:29.057 --> 04:30.817
The tenant is about to move out.

04:31.177 --> 04:34.537
If you want to come,
we'll clean it up for you.

04:34.817 --> 04:35.617
Your brother-in-law said

04:35.618 --> 04:37.976
as long as you can pay for the building fees,
utilities,

04:37.977 --> 04:38.977
and check up

04:39.297 --> 04:41.977
on Lingdang occasionally,
and play with her, that's enough.

04:43.177 --> 04:44.777
This must be our dad and mom's idea.

04:45.377 --> 04:46.537
You talked about it with them?

04:46.977 --> 04:47.977
Yeah.

04:48.057 --> 04:50.216
You see,
both your brother-in-law and I are in Shanghai.

04:50.217 --> 04:52.777
If something happens,
we can help each other.

04:54.697 --> 04:56.856
Thank you for your kind offer.

04:56.857 --> 04:58.377
But I don't think I should trouble you.

04:59.257 --> 05:00.417
I already have an intention.

05:01.337 --> 05:03.696
An alumnus of mine in Beijing

05:03.697 --> 05:05.576
is an HR professional in a five-star hotel.

05:05.577 --> 05:07.697
He wants me to work in the
Staff Training Department there.

05:09.857 --> 05:13.496
Well,
if you have a boyfriend in Beijing,

05:13.497 --> 05:15.337
I won't talk you out of it.

05:15.897 --> 05:17.697
But what do you have in Beijing?

05:19.057 --> 05:20.057
Nothing.

05:20.217 --> 05:21.497
But I'm used to living there.

05:22.177 --> 05:23.977
You seem to have gotten used to the life here.

05:27.097 --> 05:28.137
I knew it.

05:28.737 --> 05:30.417
You came here to give me a lecture.

05:30.777 --> 05:32.456
You think I'm giving you a lecture?

05:32.457 --> 05:33.817
Of course.

05:34.057 --> 05:35.456
There are four people in our family,

05:35.457 --> 05:37.057
our mom is the president,

05:37.337 --> 05:39.056
our dad is the general manager,

05:39.057 --> 05:40.656
and you're the head of a department.

05:40.657 --> 05:42.456
Only I am an employee.

05:42.457 --> 05:43.096
Right?

05:43.097 --> 05:46.056
Now the president has retired,
and you took over.

05:46.057 --> 05:48.936
So we have to report everything to you.

05:48.937 --> 05:49.696
Right?

05:49.697 --> 05:52.297
Isn't it natural for you
to give a lecture to me?

05:54.777 --> 05:55.656
By your definition,

05:55.657 --> 05:58.897
I'm the assistant
running errands for the president.

05:59.617 --> 06:03.216
And you are clearly the
boss who just took office,

06:03.217 --> 06:05.336
both capricious and stubborn.

06:05.337 --> 06:07.096
The president and
the general manager

06:07.097 --> 06:09.736
can do nothing with you
and are even afraid of you.

06:09.737 --> 06:11.656
So they want me, the assistant,
to be caught in the middle.

06:11.657 --> 06:13.097
I'm doing a thankless job.

06:13.937 --> 06:15.816
Dad and mom are afraid of me?

06:15.817 --> 06:16.496
Yeah.

06:16.497 --> 06:17.257
They're afraid of you.

06:17.258 --> 06:18.497
Always reading your face

06:18.857 --> 06:20.897
and being partial to you.

06:21.257 --> 06:24.137
They asked me to go easy on
you because I'm the older one.

06:25.457 --> 06:27.176
When did you go easy on me?

06:27.177 --> 06:28.616
Why would I go easy on you?

06:28.617 --> 06:30.216
Why should I?

06:30.217 --> 06:31.736
You crybaby.

06:31.737 --> 06:32.616
Crybaby?

06:32.617 --> 06:34.216
Yep, crybaby.

06:34.217 --> 06:37.336
Look, when we were little,
you cried when the chicken died,

06:37.337 --> 06:42.136
the rabbit died,
and even when the goldfish died.

06:42.137 --> 06:43.896
And also the henna.

06:43.897 --> 06:46.936
You cried when I picked
some henna to dye my nails.

06:46.937 --> 06:48.817
And I got scolded every time you cried.

06:49.377 --> 06:52.736
You killed the goldfish because
you gave it too much food.

06:52.737 --> 06:54.536
The rabbit had diarrhea and died

06:54.537 --> 06:56.257
because you fed it too many vegetables.

06:56.897 --> 06:58.616
And you didn't even
leave any henna for me.

06:58.617 --> 06:59.856
How could you feel aggrieved?

06:59.857 --> 07:02.736
Our mom killed the rabbit
and shifted the blame to me.

07:02.737 --> 07:05.417
How many times have I told you this?

07:05.697 --> 07:06.976
You fed it, too.

07:06.977 --> 07:07.977
Look at you.

07:08.857 --> 07:11.736
Don't tell me to look at
myself just like our dad.

07:11.737 --> 07:12.817
I'm not looking.

07:15.097 --> 07:16.097
I won't go to Shanghai.

07:16.697 --> 07:18.017
Why not?

07:18.617 --> 07:20.937
I've got many connections there.

07:21.177 --> 07:23.017
I don't want to go just
because you're there.

07:28.417 --> 07:29.256
Fine, that's better.

07:29.257 --> 07:30.537
So I won't worry about you.

07:34.337 --> 07:36.016
When two dogs bite each other,
neither gets away unscathed.

07:36.017 --> 07:37.497
- Don't talk like grandma.
- Don't talk like grandma.

07:38.777 --> 07:39.777
Finish your meal.

07:53.737 --> 07:54.137
Mom.

07:54.138 --> 07:55.976
I said what I had to say anyway.

07:55.977 --> 07:57.617
She still wants to go back to Beijing.

07:58.897 --> 08:01.216
Dou always makes us worry about her.

08:01.217 --> 08:03.176
Now she even doesn't listen to you.

08:03.177 --> 08:05.216
When did she ever listen to me?

08:05.217 --> 08:06.337
What's wrong with Dou?

08:06.577 --> 08:08.136
We don't know who she takes after.

08:08.137 --> 08:09.016
Nothing.

08:09.017 --> 08:10.457
She takes after grandma.

08:11.377 --> 08:12.353
Mom.

08:12.377 --> 08:15.096
Lingdang talks like you now.

08:15.097 --> 08:18.297
She said me and Dou are
like two dogs biting each other.

08:19.657 --> 08:21.817
It's only been two days
and you're already fighting?

08:22.337 --> 08:23.816
How could I beat her?

08:23.817 --> 08:25.337
She has a quick tongue.

08:26.017 --> 08:29.776
She said you're the president,
my dad is the manager,

08:29.777 --> 08:31.536
and I'm the head of a department.

08:31.537 --> 08:32.817
We're all disciplining her.

08:33.337 --> 08:34.977
Isn't that great?

08:37.417 --> 08:39.696
President,
there's a small thing.

08:39.697 --> 08:41.856
I don't think it's a problem,

08:41.857 --> 08:43.617
but I still think I should report to you.

08:43.937 --> 08:44.617
Don't be glib.

08:44.618 --> 08:45.777
Tell me, what is it?

08:46.137 --> 08:49.096
Do you remember the man in Dou's video?

08:49.097 --> 08:50.817
That President Xie.

08:51.937 --> 08:54.537
I felt Dou has feelings for him.

08:55.937 --> 08:57.017
Really?

08:58.897 --> 08:59.897
But

08:59.977 --> 09:01.417
he's too far away from us.

09:02.577 --> 09:04.136
But looks like Dou doesn't want

09:04.137 --> 09:05.977
to develop their relationship.

09:06.617 --> 09:08.817
Do you remember
her ex-boyfriend Ke Ji?

09:09.177 --> 09:12.736
He wanted to transfer her to the hotel
further from the city center,

09:12.737 --> 09:14.097
but she dumped him.

09:14.937 --> 09:19.336
So don't worry,
Dou won't go anywhere for a man,

09:19.337 --> 09:21.657
or stay anywhere for a man.

09:22.937 --> 09:25.496
We don't know if he
has a good personality.

09:25.497 --> 09:27.937
It's time for her to settle down.

09:30.017 --> 09:30.537
It's fine.

09:30.537 --> 09:31.136
Mom.

09:31.137 --> 09:33.456
Well, mom,
I have something to take care of.

09:33.457 --> 09:34.536
Gotta go.

09:34.537 --> 09:35.017
Alright, alright.

09:35.018 --> 09:36.136
I won't disturb your work.

09:36.137 --> 09:37.416
Your dad went grocery shopping.

09:37.417 --> 09:39.377
This afternoon,
we'll make dumplings for Kexin.

09:39.777 --> 09:40.553
OK.

09:40.577 --> 09:41.577
Bye.

09:45.097 --> 09:47.016
Auntie, what happened to Dou?

09:47.017 --> 09:47.417
Is she alright?

09:47.418 --> 09:48.617
She's fine.

09:48.977 --> 09:50.776
She's on a vacation in Yunnan.

09:50.777 --> 09:53.576
And Mi also went
there with her kid.

09:53.577 --> 09:54.777
This is nice.

09:55.337 --> 09:56.976
When Dou and Mi were little,

09:56.977 --> 09:58.936
they both had a hair-trigger temper

09:58.937 --> 10:00.817
and used to fight all the time.

10:01.417 --> 10:02.656
Easy for you to say.

10:02.657 --> 10:04.857
It's as if you never had a fight with Dou.

10:05.857 --> 10:08.336
Well,
they miss each other when they're apart,

10:08.337 --> 10:09.097
but as soon as they meet,

10:09.098 --> 10:10.897
they'll start to fight
in less than three minutes.

10:11.177 --> 10:12.177
Right.

10:12.697 --> 10:16.057
None of the girls in our
family have a good temper.

10:16.857 --> 10:21.137
If Kexin is also carrying a girl,
we'll have more fun.

10:21.657 --> 10:22.737
She better not.

10:41.097 --> 10:42.576
Xiaochun went to the warehouse.

10:42.577 --> 10:44.297
Hulu will do her homework here.

10:45.537 --> 10:46.897
Lingdang didn't go out to play?

10:50.617 --> 10:51.617
She's working?

10:54.817 --> 10:56.216
What are you doing?

10:56.217 --> 10:57.696
I'm playing Go.

10:57.697 --> 10:58.736
Can I watch you play?

10:58.737 --> 10:59.737
Sure.

11:04.697 --> 11:05.697
President Xie, you came.

11:11.617 --> 11:12.617
Hongdou.

11:12.937 --> 11:13.776
We're out of oranges.

11:13.777 --> 11:14.937
We need five more catties.

11:15.457 --> 11:16.176
I'll go.

11:16.177 --> 11:16.817
Five catties?

11:16.817 --> 11:17.536
That's heavy.

11:17.537 --> 11:18.537
I'll go with you.

11:19.137 --> 11:20.096
You aren't busy?

11:20.097 --> 11:21.097
No.

11:22.097 --> 11:22.457
Nana.

11:22.457 --> 11:23.457
The key.

11:26.337 --> 11:26.976
President Xie.

11:26.977 --> 11:28.376
The bike is inside.

11:28.377 --> 11:29.617
Wait for me here.

11:34.617 --> 11:35.737
Five catties.

11:36.337 --> 11:37.337
It's very heavy.

11:45.137 --> 11:45.976
Let's go.

11:45.977 --> 11:46.977
Go.

11:59.217 --> 12:00.217
What's wrong?

12:00.857 --> 12:02.057
You had a fight with your sister?

12:02.377 --> 12:03.696
We didn't.

12:03.697 --> 12:04.817
She didn't persuade me.

12:05.097 --> 12:06.097
Persuade you?

12:06.497 --> 12:07.497
About what?

12:08.177 --> 12:10.897
My parents have always
wanted me to work in Shanghai.

12:11.337 --> 12:12.696
My sister knew I resigned,

12:12.697 --> 12:14.337
so she came and tried
to persuade me to go to Shanghai.

12:16.417 --> 12:19.056
I guess your parents want
you two to help each other.

12:19.057 --> 12:20.176
Yeah.

12:20.177 --> 12:23.977
But if I go to Shanghai,
we won't be helping each other.

12:24.217 --> 12:26.776
It will be my sister
helping me unilaterally.

12:26.777 --> 12:28.737
She has to take on everything
and manage everything.

12:29.137 --> 12:30.937
I'll be like a parasite.

12:31.697 --> 12:33.456
Even if my brother-in-law agrees,

12:33.457 --> 12:35.497
he has a large family in Shanghai.

12:35.937 --> 12:38.177
If they know he has to
take care of his wife's sister,

12:38.417 --> 12:40.096
they will ask him to take care of his cousins

12:40.097 --> 12:41.457
and other relatives.

12:42.337 --> 12:43.496
You're not even married yet.

12:43.497 --> 12:44.617
Why do you think so much?

12:46.257 --> 12:49.657
I haven't experienced it myself,
but I've seen it.

12:51.737 --> 12:52.856
You and your sister

12:52.857 --> 12:55.097
are like a couple with a love-hate relationship.

12:55.457 --> 12:58.016
You care about each other,
but your stubborn pride

12:58.017 --> 12:59.017
forbids you to show your care for each other.

12:59.417 --> 13:02.616
I talked to her nicely,
but she got agitated.

13:02.617 --> 13:04.816
Look,
she doesn't enjoy her trip and is always

13:04.817 --> 13:06.097
working and making phone calls.

13:06.817 --> 13:08.337
She's as busy as a bee.

13:08.697 --> 13:10.097
When I talk to her, she ignores me.

13:10.577 --> 13:12.697
Since she's so busy at work,
why did she come to you?

13:13.177 --> 13:14.257
To give me a lecture.

13:15.177 --> 13:16.497
Then she could have just called you.

13:20.137 --> 13:22.576
I mean she traveled
a long way to get here,

13:22.577 --> 13:24.856
suffering from altitude sickness,
headache,

13:24.857 --> 13:26.177
and nose bleeding.

13:28.697 --> 13:29.697
Nose bleeding?

13:30.817 --> 13:31.897
Who told you this?

13:32.177 --> 13:33.337
The boss of the homestay.

13:33.857 --> 13:35.056
I called him

13:35.057 --> 13:36.896
because I wanted him
to take good care of Hongmi.

13:36.897 --> 13:37.897
He told me

13:38.137 --> 13:40.216
Hongmi called the front
desk in the middle of the night,

13:40.217 --> 13:41.456
asking for painkillers.

13:41.457 --> 13:42.336
When they were cleaning her room,

13:42.337 --> 13:44.217
they found her pillow cover
was stained with blood.

13:45.697 --> 13:47.817
You should see the essence
through the appearance.

13:48.177 --> 13:49.216
She's just worried about you

13:49.217 --> 13:51.056
after knowing that you resigned,
and came to check herself

13:51.057 --> 13:52.097
how you're doing.

15:03.857 --> 15:05.097
This is the coordinate.

15:06.057 --> 15:07.456
Good for you, Miss Expert.

15:07.457 --> 15:09.057
You know it's a coordinate.

15:11.377 --> 15:12.377
This is for you.

15:13.137 --> 15:14.456
Rhodiola tea.

15:14.457 --> 15:15.697
It can build up your resistance.

15:16.017 --> 15:17.497
The grannies in the village made it.

15:18.097 --> 15:19.217
This can is all yours.

15:22.497 --> 15:23.616
I wiped it.

15:23.617 --> 15:25.537
It's not dirty,
only the colors have faded.

15:25.817 --> 15:27.417
Inside it is good stuff.

15:27.777 --> 15:28.777
It's quite expensive.

15:29.377 --> 15:30.656
Take your time to drink it.

15:30.657 --> 15:31.737
It's good for your health.

15:33.337 --> 15:34.337
That's a lot.

15:35.337 --> 15:37.056
I just bought this cup.

15:37.057 --> 15:38.057
It's brand new.

15:38.817 --> 15:40.657
Well, the weather is dry.

15:41.017 --> 15:42.017
Drink more water

15:42.577 --> 15:43.616
and do a good job.

15:43.617 --> 15:44.257
OK.

15:44.258 --> 15:45.096
I'll go get busy.

15:45.097 --> 15:46.097
OK.

16:08.217 --> 16:09.217
Smells so good.

16:09.697 --> 16:10.616
You put roses in it?

16:10.617 --> 16:11.617
Yes.

16:13.737 --> 16:15.136
You made so much of it.

16:15.137 --> 16:15.737
Not much.

16:15.738 --> 16:17.257
I still have to share it with the neighbors.

16:17.577 --> 16:18.736
Have a taste.

16:18.737 --> 16:20.377
I'll get you some more cups.

16:21.537 --> 16:22.737
Try if it tastes good.

16:29.337 --> 16:30.617
It does taste like roses.

16:30.857 --> 16:31.536
You take a try.

16:31.537 --> 16:32.537
Take another sip.

16:42.937 --> 16:44.736
Tonight,
when we treat your sister to dinner,

16:44.737 --> 16:45.737
let her try it, too.

16:46.857 --> 16:47.377
You know what?

16:47.378 --> 16:49.657
I found that after I got here,

16:50.097 --> 16:51.257
no matter where I go,

16:51.577 --> 16:53.897
no one let me
leave empty-handed.

16:54.617 --> 16:55.496
Rest assured.

16:55.497 --> 16:58.617
When you leave here,
I won't let you go empty-handed.

17:00.137 --> 17:01.897
What are you going to give me?

17:03.337 --> 17:04.176
You name it.

17:04.177 --> 17:05.177
What do you want?

17:06.097 --> 17:07.217
Anything will do?

17:09.897 --> 17:10.897
Anything but money.

17:13.257 --> 17:14.257
Relax.

17:14.617 --> 17:16.737
I will only ask for what you have.

17:25.017 --> 17:25.457
Here they are.

17:25.457 --> 17:26.457
Come on.

17:26.577 --> 17:27.217
Help me serve it.

17:27.217 --> 17:27.856
Here.

17:27.857 --> 17:28.857
Use this.

17:29.377 --> 17:30.657
Yes, you can use either of them.

17:40.137 --> 17:41.096
Stop playing.

17:41.097 --> 17:42.456
Wash your hands and get ready for dinner.

17:42.457 --> 17:43.857
Lingdang, let's go.

17:49.057 --> 17:50.057
Xu Hongdou.

17:50.177 --> 17:52.496
Can you take a look at
what's on the back of my neck?

17:52.497 --> 17:53.336
Don't move.

17:53.337 --> 17:54.256
It's a bee.

17:54.257 --> 17:55.297
Help me get rid of it.

17:58.137 --> 17:59.137
It's gone?

17:59.937 --> 18:00.536
Don't touch it.

18:00.537 --> 18:01.896
Did you get stung? Let me see.

18:01.897 --> 18:03.056
I hope not.

18:03.057 --> 18:04.057
Did I?

18:11.537 --> 18:13.097
Dinner is ready.

18:13.337 --> 18:14.337
Go.

18:21.737 --> 18:22.737
Hongmi.

18:23.017 --> 18:25.016
This is rose wine a
granny in the village made.

18:25.017 --> 18:26.017
Have a taste.

18:27.017 --> 18:28.297
In her house,

18:28.777 --> 18:29.457
I saw a lot of vats this big.

18:29.458 --> 18:30.656
They're all full of this wine.

18:30.657 --> 18:31.256
Try it.

18:31.257 --> 18:31.896
Yeah.

18:31.897 --> 18:33.576
If someone gets married in the village,

18:33.577 --> 18:34.697
we need to prepare it in advance.

18:35.697 --> 18:36.697
OK.

18:37.097 --> 18:39.896
This glass of wine
is a send-off to me.

18:39.897 --> 18:41.417
I'll leave tomorrow morning.

18:42.137 --> 18:43.857
I thought you said you were leaving
the day after tomorrow.

18:44.657 --> 18:47.176
I was just informed to make
a business trip to Beijing,

18:47.177 --> 18:48.777
and then go back to Shanghai
the day after tomorrow.

18:49.937 --> 18:51.017
Are you talking Lingdang with you?

18:51.817 --> 18:53.137
My assistant is going with us.

18:53.617 --> 18:56.897
I was planning to show
you around the old town.

18:57.257 --> 18:58.257
No need.

18:58.337 --> 19:01.056
I'm not here for
sightseeing anyway.

19:01.057 --> 19:02.857
I'm here to give you a lecture.

19:06.137 --> 19:07.497
Thank you for your treat.

19:07.977 --> 19:09.456
I must have caused trouble for you.

19:09.457 --> 19:10.456
Not at all.

19:10.457 --> 19:12.336
I was hoping you could stay longer.

19:12.337 --> 19:13.697
I'm not being polite.

19:14.137 --> 19:14.416
Cheers.

19:14.417 --> 19:15.416
Mi, drink less.

19:15.417 --> 19:16.417
You're going on a business trip.

19:22.777 --> 19:23.857
Does it taste good?

19:25.337 --> 19:27.896
It's made of the roses
that you said were ugly

19:27.897 --> 19:29.657
when we drove past the rose garden.

19:30.457 --> 19:31.256
Did I say it?

19:31.257 --> 19:32.056
You did.

19:32.057 --> 19:33.497
You said it as we passed them.

19:34.537 --> 19:35.857
Don't pretend that you don't remember.

19:36.137 --> 19:36.976
President Xie heard it, too.

19:36.977 --> 19:37.977
Right?

19:40.337 --> 19:41.456
I didn't.

19:41.457 --> 19:42.697
I was driving.

19:46.897 --> 19:47.897
President Xie.

19:47.977 --> 19:48.977
Come on.

19:50.017 --> 19:51.017
Wish you a brisk business.

19:51.217 --> 19:52.217
Thank you.

19:53.257 --> 19:54.017
Auntie Hongmi.

19:54.018 --> 19:56.617
When are you gonna bring Lingdang over again?

19:57.977 --> 20:00.336
We may not come again.

20:00.337 --> 20:01.976
Because we came here for a tour.

20:01.977 --> 20:04.457
We'll travel somewhere else next time.

20:05.057 --> 20:07.497
Aren't we going to visit Aunt Hongdou?

20:09.777 --> 20:12.617
Aunt Hongdou is here for a tour, too.

20:17.337 --> 20:18.696
It doesn't matter.

20:18.697 --> 20:21.016
When you go home,
you can still see each other

20:21.017 --> 20:22.017
in video calls.

20:23.737 --> 20:24.553
Yeah.

20:24.577 --> 20:25.577
You can make calls.

20:33.777 --> 20:34.777
Let's eat.

20:55.617 --> 20:56.553
Hongmi.

20:56.577 --> 20:58.337
Drink this honey water.

20:58.737 --> 21:00.496
Rice wine tastes mild,
but it's still wine.

21:00.497 --> 21:01.737
You will be going on a business trip.

21:05.097 --> 21:06.417
Are you going to Shanghai?

21:10.217 --> 21:11.617
Drink this first, alright?

21:12.497 --> 21:13.697
Are you going or not?

21:16.777 --> 21:17.777
I...

21:18.617 --> 21:19.937
I'll go visit you when I have some free time.

21:20.257 --> 21:21.257
Alright?

21:23.577 --> 21:24.577
I know

21:25.497 --> 21:26.817
you hate me.

21:30.177 --> 21:31.016
I don't hate you.

21:31.017 --> 21:32.617
You hate me.

21:34.577 --> 21:37.057
You don't want to
go because I'm there.

21:42.977 --> 21:45.057
That's the only
sentence you remember.

21:47.017 --> 21:48.017
It's my fault.

21:49.457 --> 21:50.697
I shouldn't have said that.

21:51.697 --> 21:53.617
Do you know what I actually mean?

21:54.057 --> 21:55.737
I don't want to cause you trouble.

21:56.777 --> 21:59.097
You don't want to cause us trouble.

21:59.377 --> 22:02.297
But can you manage your life well?

22:02.737 --> 22:05.177
You didn't even tell us that you quit your job.

22:07.497 --> 22:09.377
You don't tell me anything now.

22:10.977 --> 22:12.977
I can only find out what you're doing

22:13.577 --> 22:16.457
from your WeChat
Moments or your friends.

22:19.577 --> 22:21.336
I miss the time when we were little.

22:21.337 --> 22:22.937
You were always

22:23.337 --> 22:24.937
following me around.

22:25.577 --> 22:26.617
The little Hongdou.

22:35.257 --> 22:37.056
I'm so mad at you.

22:37.057 --> 22:38.096
Are you acting crazy while drunk?

22:38.097 --> 22:39.296
Why are you hitting me?

22:39.297 --> 22:41.456
I want to... Crazy woman.

22:41.457 --> 22:42.496
I want to hit you.

22:42.497 --> 22:43.536
I'll fight back if you keep hitting me.

22:43.537 --> 22:43.817
I want to hit you.

22:43.817 --> 22:44.576
I'm fighting back.

22:44.577 --> 22:46.016
She's drunk.

22:46.017 --> 22:46.697
Why are you sitting here
and letting her hit you?

22:46.698 --> 22:48.136
Run now.

22:48.137 --> 22:50.657
I'll tell mom and dad that
you're drunk and you hit me.

22:51.697 --> 22:53.496
I will tell mom that you had
puppy love with alcohol bottles

22:53.497 --> 22:54.937
when you were in junior high.

22:55.657 --> 22:57.497
When did I have puppy
love with alcohol bottles?

22:57.937 --> 22:58.937
You did.

22:59.457 --> 23:01.657
You mean drift bottles?

23:02.337 --> 23:03.337
You two.

23:03.937 --> 23:04.976
I'll tell on you.

23:04.977 --> 23:06.377
Don't get too obsessed.

23:17.737 --> 23:18.737
It's fine.

23:25.217 --> 23:26.257
This is the backyard.

23:27.297 --> 23:29.056
The main body of the
building has been constructed.

23:29.057 --> 23:30.416
There are eight rooms in total.

23:30.417 --> 23:32.696
Even the smallest room
measures around 40 square meters.

23:32.697 --> 23:33.857
Look over here.

23:34.257 --> 23:37.377
There are four suites upstairs
with a pretty good view.

23:37.977 --> 23:40.656
The boss positions it
as a boutique homestay.

23:40.657 --> 23:41.856
Sounds pretty good.

23:41.857 --> 23:42.857
Right.

23:42.897 --> 23:45.816
Yes,
the boss said the main body of the building

23:45.817 --> 23:48.096
and the interior decoration
were designed at the same time.

23:48.097 --> 23:51.577
If you need it,
he can give you the design drawings.

23:52.297 --> 23:53.416
We'll look around.

23:53.417 --> 23:54.617
Take your time.

24:08.457 --> 24:09.457
Give me a refill.

24:09.857 --> 24:11.216
Huang.

24:11.217 --> 24:12.656
This is triple espresso.

24:12.657 --> 24:15.377
You can't drink anymore or
it'll keep you awake at night.

24:15.817 --> 24:17.816
Look at the amount of exercise I got in the day.

24:17.817 --> 24:19.736
If you throw a pillow into the pigsty,

24:19.737 --> 24:21.937
I'll fall asleep on it immediately.

24:23.497 --> 24:25.136
We have Bestway having been
cold brewed for a day.

24:25.137 --> 24:26.217
How about a change?

24:26.937 --> 24:27.937
Good.

24:30.497 --> 24:30.977
Is that her?

24:30.978 --> 24:32.377
Is she an Internet celebrity?

24:43.137 --> 24:44.137
What's wrong?

24:44.817 --> 24:45.977
Someone's taking pictures of me.

24:53.257 --> 24:54.976
Where are you from?

24:54.977 --> 24:56.897
We came from Shanghai.

24:57.217 --> 24:58.217
Shanghai?

24:59.377 --> 25:02.296
So why did you choose to come here?

25:02.297 --> 25:04.536
We saw the promotional video you shot.

25:04.537 --> 25:06.497
You're even better looking in person.

25:06.737 --> 25:07.896
Promotional video?

25:07.897 --> 25:08.897
Yes.

25:11.657 --> 25:13.376
So what do you think of our place?

25:13.377 --> 25:14.096
Very nice.

25:14.097 --> 25:15.536
We just arrived this morning.

25:15.537 --> 25:18.096
We want to go to
the beautiful places

25:18.097 --> 25:19.056
appeared in the promotional video.

25:19.057 --> 25:19.456
Yeah.

25:19.457 --> 25:20.856
I know those places.

25:20.857 --> 25:21.137
You know?

25:21.137 --> 25:21.697
I can fill you in.

25:21.697 --> 25:22.256
Yeah.

25:22.257 --> 25:23.057
Can I friend you on WeChat?

25:23.057 --> 25:23.697
Come on.

25:23.697 --> 25:24.057
Of course.

25:24.057 --> 25:24.776
Great.

25:24.777 --> 25:25.497
We gotta go.

25:25.497 --> 25:26.497
- Bye.
- Bye.

25:40.017 --> 25:41.977
Do you have a camera phobia?

25:44.777 --> 25:47.017
Kind of.

25:49.457 --> 25:52.256
Isn't it annoying that
such a pretty girl like you

25:52.257 --> 25:53.497
always get your pictures taken by strangers?

25:55.017 --> 25:56.057
I'm pretty?

25:58.977 --> 26:01.137
Then tell me, why am I pretty?

26:02.697 --> 26:05.896
You're pretty in
a low-profile way.

26:05.897 --> 26:07.296
You have this implicit beauty.

26:07.297 --> 26:08.977
You haven't realized
how beautiful you are.

26:10.137 --> 26:11.536
That sounds comfortable.

26:11.537 --> 26:12.336
Don't get cocky.

26:12.337 --> 26:13.057
Alright, I should go.

26:13.057 --> 26:14.057
To the village committee.

26:14.537 --> 26:15.353
By the way,

26:15.377 --> 26:17.056
I've packed your Bestway.

26:17.057 --> 26:18.057
Thanks.

26:18.577 --> 26:20.177
Don't forget to try my sample tomorrow.

26:20.977 --> 26:21.936
Try your poison.

26:21.937 --> 26:22.976
You should go find Xiaxia.

26:22.977 --> 26:24.136
Gotta go, bye.

26:24.137 --> 26:25.137
See you.

26:36.697 --> 26:37.697
She left in the morning.

26:38.217 --> 26:39.936
Hongdou isn't like her sister at all.

26:39.937 --> 26:41.056
You also met her?

26:41.057 --> 26:42.177
She came to the woodcarving workshop.

26:42.497 --> 26:44.057
The wood painting hanging

26:44.497 --> 26:45.576
on the wall in the east room for two years

26:45.577 --> 26:46.577
was carved by my master.

26:46.857 --> 26:48.416
It's the most expensive treasure
in our workshop.

26:48.417 --> 26:49.417
She bought it.

26:50.377 --> 26:53.737
I saw the name of the
recipient was Xu Hongmi.

26:54.417 --> 26:56.257
Then I asked her if
she's Hongdou's sister.

26:57.257 --> 26:58.257
She said yes.

26:58.977 --> 27:01.577
Tell Xiaolan quickly to
remove it from the online store.

27:02.217 --> 27:03.217
Don't worry.

27:03.537 --> 27:05.097
I told him as soon as she bought it.

27:06.297 --> 27:07.697
[Unknown Number]

27:11.577 --> 27:12.937
Hello? Who is it?

27:14.817 --> 27:15.337
Yeah, yeah.

27:15.338 --> 27:16.657
This is Youfeng Yard.

27:16.937 --> 27:17.937
You can choose a short-term rental.

27:19.217 --> 27:20.857
Are you a couple or are you coming alone?

27:21.337 --> 27:22.417
Thanks, mom.

27:23.017 --> 27:24.056
A girl, right?

27:24.057 --> 27:25.337
When will you arrive?

27:26.497 --> 27:26.976
OK.

27:26.977 --> 27:27.816
I'll make a record.

27:27.817 --> 27:28.817
Please hold on.

27:29.217 --> 27:30.976
They wouldn't let me sing that song at first,

27:30.977 --> 27:32.376
but their own song.

27:32.377 --> 27:35.616
I said, "Wait, wait, wait,
listen to my song first.

27:35.617 --> 27:37.096
If you think it isn't good,
I will sing your song."

27:37.097 --> 27:38.616
Then I started singing.

27:38.617 --> 27:40.096
The person in charge said,
"Alright, alright.

27:40.097 --> 27:41.416
Hu, stop it.

27:41.417 --> 27:42.456
We know."

27:42.457 --> 27:43.817
Then did you sing your song?

27:44.657 --> 27:45.216
No.

27:45.217 --> 27:46.576
I sang their song.

27:46.577 --> 27:47.976
They didn't have the luck to hear it.

27:47.977 --> 27:48.977
Two characters.

27:49.457 --> 27:50.457
Pung.

27:50.657 --> 27:51.657
Sorry.

27:52.537 --> 27:53.096
Granny.

27:53.097 --> 27:54.056
Did you do fishing?

27:54.057 --> 27:54.976
No.

27:54.977 --> 27:56.817
I haven't got a pair.

27:57.857 --> 27:58.857
Pung.

28:01.497 --> 28:02.497
Three characters.

28:04.217 --> 28:05.336
Don't peep.

28:05.337 --> 28:06.937
I'm helping you.

28:10.337 --> 28:11.456
Thank you, but no need.

28:11.457 --> 28:13.776
I won by my own draw.
Just did fishing in the last round.

28:13.777 --> 28:14.816
Not bad, Hongdou.

28:14.817 --> 28:16.497
This is a very strong hand.

28:17.217 --> 28:17.616
Come on.

28:17.617 --> 28:17.857
Well.

28:17.858 --> 28:19.576
You could still win like this?

28:19.577 --> 28:20.737
Anyway, I won.

28:21.417 --> 28:22.417
Yao.

28:23.377 --> 28:24.057
Auntie Feng, we're in the room.

28:24.058 --> 28:25.216
Are you playing mahjong?

28:25.217 --> 28:25.937
Here, I got some vegetables for you.

28:25.937 --> 28:26.937
Hello, Auntie Feng.

28:27.337 --> 28:28.537
I went to the farm this afternoon.

28:28.897 --> 28:30.136
There are so many of them.

28:30.137 --> 28:30.937
Thank you, thank you.

28:30.938 --> 28:32.056
It's fresh.

28:32.057 --> 28:32.417
No, no.

28:32.417 --> 28:32.897
Sit in my seat.

28:32.897 --> 28:33.217
I'm not.

28:33.218 --> 28:34.616
I'm not playing.

28:34.617 --> 28:36.056
I will sit with Granny for a while.

28:36.057 --> 28:36.857
Auntie Feng, play with us.

28:36.857 --> 28:37.577
Don't let him play.

28:37.577 --> 28:38.337
He's got such a bad hand.

28:38.337 --> 28:39.337
What bad luck.

28:39.817 --> 28:41.497
I was trying to let you win.

28:42.137 --> 28:43.137
Well,

28:43.217 --> 28:44.017
you guys play.

28:44.018 --> 28:45.816
I'll go make you
some wolfberry tea.

28:45.817 --> 28:46.817
Hongdou, how is it?

28:47.257 --> 28:49.337
Where's the Pu'er
Tea brought by Mr. Ma?

28:49.857 --> 28:51.456
Why do you wanna drink Pu'er Tea at night?

28:51.457 --> 28:52.457
Wolfberry it is.

28:52.617 --> 28:53.617
Then why did you ask me?

28:54.217 --> 28:55.217
Keep playing.

29:01.697 --> 29:02.616
Don't play this.

29:02.617 --> 29:03.736
Play that, that one.

29:03.737 --> 29:05.377
That's a single wait.

29:05.657 --> 29:07.056
But I don't see it on the table.

29:07.057 --> 29:08.857
What if they have it?

29:09.257 --> 29:10.233
Excuse me,

29:10.257 --> 29:11.297
are you having a meeting?

29:11.977 --> 29:12.977
Then play this.

29:13.777 --> 29:14.777
Seven dots.

29:14.977 --> 29:15.977
Kong.

29:18.977 --> 29:20.136
You newbie.

29:20.137 --> 29:21.296
Don't mislead me.

29:21.297 --> 29:21.657
Bad hand.

29:21.657 --> 29:22.416
That's true.

29:22.417 --> 29:23.336
No, Auntie Feng.

29:23.337 --> 29:24.736
You're not playing fairly.

29:24.737 --> 29:26.257
You went over the line, really.

29:26.577 --> 29:27.577
Four characters.

29:27.857 --> 29:28.857
Bingo.

29:30.737 --> 29:31.777
Granny, you...

29:32.217 --> 29:34.136
This is not time for it yet.

29:34.137 --> 29:37.136
But at least I won.

29:37.137 --> 29:39.577
It's pure one suit.

29:40.217 --> 29:42.016
You guys have been whispering to each other.

29:42.017 --> 29:43.256
This is all your fault.

29:43.257 --> 29:44.257
Newbie.

29:47.857 --> 29:49.937
What a pity.

30:37.817 --> 30:40.177
How long are you going to stay this time?

30:41.457 --> 30:42.617
Tomorrow,

30:43.217 --> 30:44.776
I'll go meet some tea masters

30:44.777 --> 30:46.017
and then go back to Beijing at night.

30:46.977 --> 30:48.097
Is she coming?

30:48.457 --> 30:49.457
Is she coming?

30:52.497 --> 30:54.497
You started to eat already?

30:55.017 --> 30:57.376
This is for our new neighbor, the pretty girl.

30:57.377 --> 30:58.376
You're leaving

30:58.377 --> 31:00.096
all the seed shells
and peanut shells on the table.

31:00.097 --> 31:02.736
She will think that
we don't respect her.

31:02.737 --> 31:04.296
Calm down.

31:04.297 --> 31:05.496
Why do you always look so excited

31:05.497 --> 31:07.296
every time you meet a girl?

31:07.297 --> 31:08.976
What do you mean by "look excited"?

31:08.977 --> 31:10.896
I am excited, alright?

31:10.897 --> 31:12.577
I'm just so happy.

31:13.257 --> 31:16.097
What if this new neighbor
falls in love with me?

31:16.337 --> 31:19.937
Then we will have
a sweet love story.

31:21.657 --> 31:22.297
This is good tea.

31:22.298 --> 31:23.537
I really don't want to throw it up.

31:24.137 --> 31:26.256
Go ahead, you go ahead.

31:26.257 --> 31:27.536
Let me tell you, Ma.

31:27.537 --> 31:31.576
Since you started your business,
you've become so vulgar.

31:31.577 --> 31:33.616
And you're no longer a man with depth.

31:33.617 --> 31:34.656
Go get prepared.

31:34.657 --> 31:37.016
Later, you will perform a tea
ceremony for our new neighbor.

31:37.017 --> 31:38.017
Pooh.

31:38.537 --> 31:39.353
Hongdou.

31:39.377 --> 31:39.936
Come on.

31:39.937 --> 31:40.776
What?

31:40.777 --> 31:41.777
Take it, take it.

31:42.017 --> 31:43.416
Have you seen this?

31:43.417 --> 31:47.216
Later, when I sing this part,
"Meeting you

31:47.217 --> 31:49.497
is like a bamboo forest meeting early summer,

31:49.817 --> 31:51.857
birds meeting waves,

31:52.097 --> 31:52.337
and desert..."

31:52.337 --> 31:52.937
You're so cooperative.

31:52.937 --> 31:53.457
Right, right.

31:53.458 --> 31:54.536
That's the feeling.

31:54.537 --> 31:55.856
You're doing it perfectly.

31:55.857 --> 31:58.096
Listen,
you should be kneeling outside the door.

31:58.097 --> 31:59.456
That's the most effective way.

31:59.457 --> 32:00.817
You are such a nuisance.

32:01.537 --> 32:02.537
What's wrong with me?

32:02.697 --> 32:03.656
Don't move.

32:03.657 --> 32:04.657
I'll help you with it.

32:04.857 --> 32:05.816
She's here, she's here.

32:05.817 --> 32:06.817
Line up now.

32:07.137 --> 32:08.096
Smile.

32:08.097 --> 32:09.297
Show me your smile.

32:15.857 --> 32:16.937
Xinxin is also here.

32:17.857 --> 32:18.937
Where's our new neighbor?

32:19.617 --> 32:21.016
Let me introduce her to you.

32:21.017 --> 32:23.857
Our new tenant,
and your new neighbor.

32:24.817 --> 32:26.616
I'm your new neighbor.

32:26.617 --> 32:28.497
Surprise!

32:31.097 --> 32:31.976
Go back to our rooms.

32:31.977 --> 32:32.537
No.

32:32.538 --> 32:33.496
Go back.

32:33.497 --> 32:34.336
What's wrong with you, Hu?

32:34.337 --> 32:35.456
What are you doing?

32:35.457 --> 32:36.496
I was just kidding you.

32:36.497 --> 32:37.497
Don't get so serious.

32:38.097 --> 32:39.016
Xinxin.

32:39.017 --> 32:40.536
Are you really moving in?

32:40.537 --> 32:42.976
Her dorm is leaking,
and the roof needs to be fixed.

32:42.977 --> 32:44.577
So she'll stay here for only two months.

32:45.217 --> 32:46.216
Hu.

32:46.217 --> 32:47.576
Don't be discouraged.

32:47.577 --> 32:49.337
In a couple of days,
a female tenant will move in.

32:50.457 --> 32:51.216
Are you sure?

32:51.217 --> 32:52.497
I'm sure.

32:53.377 --> 32:54.377
When will she come?

32:54.737 --> 32:56.497
You're not bidding me welcome?

32:58.017 --> 32:59.297
I don't mean that, Huang.

32:59.777 --> 33:00.777
It's just

33:01.097 --> 33:02.217
you played with my feelings.

33:02.857 --> 33:03.856
Xinxin.

33:03.857 --> 33:04.816
Have a seat first.

33:04.817 --> 33:07.736
Later,
Mr. Ma will perform a tea ceremony for you.

33:07.737 --> 33:09.496
I'll help you unpack.

33:09.497 --> 33:10.497
OK.

33:11.337 --> 33:13.016
Nana told me that you're
really good at making beds.

33:13.017 --> 33:13.736
Can you teach me?

33:13.737 --> 33:14.896
Alright, I'll make your bed.

33:14.897 --> 33:15.736
Good.

33:15.737 --> 33:17.257
Thank you then.

33:20.417 --> 33:21.577
You're leaving?

33:22.617 --> 33:24.177
I told Yao

33:24.457 --> 33:25.897
that I wouldn't come
to do volunteer work these days.

33:26.137 --> 33:27.137
I'll take a couple of days off.

33:27.537 --> 33:28.537
You... You...

33:29.257 --> 33:30.697
Will you come back?

33:31.457 --> 33:32.457
Yes.

33:32.737 --> 33:34.057
I will definitely come to visit you.

33:34.857 --> 33:36.657
Then what will Yao do?

33:39.817 --> 33:41.576
The new volunteer is coming.

33:41.577 --> 33:42.657
He'll be fine.

33:43.577 --> 33:45.497
You're leaving Yao behind?

33:47.817 --> 33:48.817
Yeah.

33:50.257 --> 33:51.257
You...

34:00.697 --> 34:01.896
Did you disinfect it?

34:01.897 --> 34:02.776
Rest assured.

34:02.777 --> 34:04.257
It's all been sterilized with alcohol.

34:04.937 --> 34:06.976
We're only sending ten bottles
to Hongdou's sister.

34:06.977 --> 34:08.337
Will it be enough?

34:08.737 --> 34:10.777
We should send some more if she likes them.

34:11.897 --> 34:13.216
These will do for now.

34:13.217 --> 34:14.337
If she wants more, we'll send her more.

34:15.017 --> 34:16.177
That's true.

34:17.657 --> 34:19.057
Xiaochun told me

34:19.737 --> 34:21.376
that Hongdou's lease is running out

34:21.377 --> 34:23.057
and she hasn't renewed it.

34:24.257 --> 34:25.336
Yeah.

34:25.337 --> 34:26.977
She's going back to find a job.

34:27.617 --> 34:30.297
So what's happening
between the two of you?

34:31.377 --> 34:32.377
No.

34:32.457 --> 34:34.617
So we refuted the rumor and no one believes us?

34:35.137 --> 34:37.137
So for your information,

34:37.377 --> 34:39.656
I will ask Xiaochun to
find some more people

34:39.657 --> 34:41.097
and try to set you up.

34:42.377 --> 34:43.057
Look at me.

34:43.058 --> 34:44.696
Do I have time for a relationship?

34:44.697 --> 34:46.736
Girls don't have time for relationships, too.

34:46.737 --> 34:48.657
They all do it while working.

34:50.497 --> 34:52.697
Someone is pursuing Xiaochun.

34:54.777 --> 34:55.696
Who is he?

34:55.697 --> 34:56.897
A supplier.

34:57.657 --> 34:58.776
He gave her a voice call.

34:58.777 --> 35:00.977
I heard him say he
wanted to ask her out.

35:02.377 --> 35:03.577
Then what did Xiaochun say?

35:04.017 --> 35:05.017
"I have no time!"

35:08.657 --> 35:09.576
You know what?

35:09.577 --> 35:11.896
It's tiring to fetch water alone.

35:11.897 --> 35:14.017
You need to find someone
to share the work with you.

35:14.377 --> 35:17.097
You young people will
regret it in the future.

35:18.857 --> 35:19.977
Fill the wine.

35:24.497 --> 35:25.497
Come on.

35:42.217 --> 35:44.497
[Do I need to give Aunt Baoping money?]

35:46.497 --> 35:51.456
♫ I've been alone into the unknown ♫

35:51.457 --> 35:53.297
[She'll drive you out if you give her money.]

35:56.097 --> 36:01.057
[I can't take her things for free all the time.]

36:04.977 --> 36:07.336
[She'll be happy if you tell her
her wine tastes good.]

36:07.337 --> 36:09.296
[Ha ha ha ha]

36:09.297 --> 36:13.097
[I see. She's like my mom.]

36:14.817 --> 36:18.817
[By the way, Granny wants me to ask you
what do you wanna eat tomorrow.]

36:19.297 --> 36:21.937
[I like everything she makes.]

36:23.137 --> 36:28.497
[Do you wanna eat the rice noodles
in the market tomorrow morning?]

36:29.817 --> 36:34.217
[I can't get up that early.]

36:36.377 --> 36:38.377
[I'll come to wake you up.]

36:43.857 --> 36:50.697
♫ You ask me if the wind could sing ♫

36:50.937 --> 36:57.657
♫ We close our eyes to feel it ♫

36:58.617 --> 36:59.616
Come on.

36:59.617 --> 37:01.616
Drink the bowfish soup.

37:01.617 --> 37:03.216
I put herbs in it.

37:03.217 --> 37:04.856
You're always so busy.

37:04.857 --> 37:06.616
Have something nutritious.

37:06.617 --> 37:08.456
Put it here, granny.

37:08.457 --> 37:10.057
You're treating me like a baby.

37:10.537 --> 37:12.056
It'll soon get cold.

37:12.057 --> 37:13.057
Here.

37:20.217 --> 37:20.896
Tastes great.

37:20.897 --> 37:22.136
OK, I've drunk it.

37:22.137 --> 37:23.376
Just leave it here.

37:23.377 --> 37:24.336
You've served a lot.

37:24.337 --> 37:25.337
Do you think I'm a pig?

37:25.577 --> 37:26.936
What nonsense.

37:26.937 --> 37:29.017
You need to take care of your health.

37:36.257 --> 37:38.016
Don't hide it.

37:38.017 --> 37:40.177
I've seen it before.

37:40.497 --> 37:40.977
No.

37:40.978 --> 37:42.416
I just think this is a nice photo.

37:42.417 --> 37:44.376
Look at those big
eyes Lil Cute has.

37:44.377 --> 37:45.616
Don't get me wrong.

37:45.617 --> 37:46.977
Did I say anything?

37:47.377 --> 37:48.537
Caught you.

37:49.377 --> 37:50.377
Remember to drink it.

37:53.257 --> 37:54.257
Granny.

37:55.417 --> 37:57.737
Don't tell people about this.

38:13.297 --> 38:15.377
[OK.]

38:28.817 --> 38:33.297
♫ Seeing a star and a rainbow ♫

38:33.937 --> 38:36.457
♫ every step on your journey ♫

38:38.417 --> 38:41.417
♫ We've missed and hugged each other ♫

38:42.057 --> 38:46.217
♫ There are breezes in some parts of the world ♫

38:46.937 --> 38:49.377
♫ and some touching moments ♫

38:51.657 --> 38:54.537
♫ Whose dream will be fulfilled ♫

38:55.297 --> 39:00.817
♫ In the street where rain or sunshine falls ♫

39:01.377 --> 39:08.217
♫ Say goodbye to the passing time ♫

39:08.857 --> 39:12.377
♫ Sometimes I need a beautiful smile ♫

39:13.737 --> 39:17.617
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

39:18.217 --> 39:21.737
♫ I still love them as when I was young ♫

39:22.017 --> 39:25.937
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

39:27.097 --> 39:30.537
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

39:31.377 --> 39:35.577
♫ Maybe things will go your way ♫

39:47.697 --> 39:52.057
♫ Flowers bloom in the wind ♫

39:52.737 --> 39:55.297
♫ Twilight awakens the stars ♫

39:57.137 --> 40:00.497
♫ Those are the good times ♫

40:01.177 --> 40:06.857
♫ In the street where rain or sunshine falls ♫

40:07.377 --> 40:10.496
♫ Say goodbye to the passing time ♫

40:10.497 --> 40:12.057
I'm up. I'll be right there.

40:13.617 --> 40:14.736
Are we going to walk there?

40:14.737 --> 40:15.737
Alright.

40:16.017 --> 40:17.137
Wait for me.

40:18.137 --> 40:19.816
You're wearing a new shirt.

40:19.817 --> 40:20.297
No.

40:20.297 --> 40:21.337
I bought it last year.

40:22.697 --> 40:23.857
Take off the price tag.

40:24.257 --> 40:27.617
♫ I still love them as when I was young ♫

40:28.017 --> 40:31.857
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

40:32.857 --> 40:36.417
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

40:38.297 --> 40:39.297
Let's go.

40:41.377 --> 40:43.056
You're wearing makeup for breakfast?

40:43.057 --> 40:44.696
I... I'm not.

40:44.697 --> 40:47.137
I just filled in my eyebrows
applied air cushion,

40:47.417 --> 40:49.817
lipstick,
and sprayed some perfume.

40:53.697 --> 40:55.097
Did you take off the tag?

40:55.977 --> 40:57.056
Do you want it?

40:57.057 --> 40:58.577
What do I want that for?

40:59.097 --> 41:00.497
Then don't ask.

41:02.017 --> 41:03.337
You don't need to feel embarrassed.

41:03.857 --> 41:04.937
You know what?

41:05.537 --> 41:07.216
One time Chen Nanxing and I went shopping

41:07.217 --> 41:08.497
and I bought a dress.

41:09.417 --> 41:11.537
But I went outside wearing it backwards.

41:12.137 --> 41:13.256
Who found it?

41:13.257 --> 41:14.376
My neck.

41:14.377 --> 41:15.377
I felt suffocating.

41:15.617 --> 41:17.057
You did such a stupid thing before?

41:19.777 --> 41:21.057
You're wearing perfume?

41:21.817 --> 41:23.496
It's honey body wash.

41:23.497 --> 41:24.777
You have a nose of a bloodhound.

41:25.457 --> 41:26.457
It smells good.

41:26.657 --> 41:27.456
What brand is it?

41:27.457 --> 41:29.216
Just an old domestic brand.

41:29.217 --> 41:30.217
It's not expensive.

41:33.737 --> 41:35.976
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

41:35.977 --> 41:37.217
The rice noodles are ready.

41:41.977 --> 41:42.977
Does it taste good?

42:09.977 --> 42:11.097
I saw on the market

42:11.657 --> 42:14.696
that Hongdou and Yao were eating rice noodles.

42:14.697 --> 42:15.977
They were pretty close.

42:17.217 --> 42:18.056
The night before last,

42:18.057 --> 42:19.736
I went to play mahjong at Yao's place,

42:19.737 --> 42:21.816
and I saw them together.

42:21.817 --> 42:22.937
They were close.

42:23.497 --> 42:24.737
Let's not make wild guesses.

42:25.017 --> 42:27.376
Hongdou doesn't do volunteer work now.

42:27.377 --> 42:29.657
And she's not renewing her lease.

42:29.977 --> 42:30.217
Yeah.

42:30.218 --> 42:32.817
I don't think it will work out between them.

42:33.977 --> 42:35.497
We've all been there.

42:36.057 --> 42:38.136
Look at those little tricks they use.

42:38.137 --> 42:39.216
Won't work out?

42:39.217 --> 42:40.377
Who would believe it?

42:41.897 --> 42:42.897
Let's put it this way.

42:43.457 --> 42:47.216
They two do like each other,
but the place isn't right.

42:47.217 --> 42:49.217
Hongdou will go back to Beijing.

42:49.537 --> 42:51.137
She can't get used to the life here?

42:51.417 --> 42:52.816
Not really.

42:52.817 --> 42:55.216
Hongdou is just
having a vacation here,

42:55.217 --> 42:56.496
and she doesn't stay for long.

42:56.497 --> 43:00.856
So our place isn't in her life plan,
understand?

43:00.857 --> 43:01.576
Understood.

43:01.577 --> 43:02.657
She can't get used to living here.

43:04.057 --> 43:05.496
It's not that.

43:05.497 --> 43:07.456
Their relationship hasn't been developed

43:07.457 --> 43:08.856
to the point that she'll consider

43:08.857 --> 43:11.216
whether she'll get used to the life here.

43:11.217 --> 43:12.577
Then develop it.

43:13.537 --> 43:15.896
They can't develop it further.

43:15.897 --> 43:17.137
She can't adjust to the life here?

43:17.937 --> 43:19.417
No, this is not the point.

43:19.737 --> 43:20.977
Can't you understand?

43:21.497 --> 43:23.736
Hongdou comes from a big city.

43:23.737 --> 43:26.936
How could she settle down in a village?

43:26.937 --> 43:28.617
So she hasn't got used to living here.

43:29.417 --> 43:29.657
Yeah.

43:29.657 --> 43:30.417
You're right.

43:30.417 --> 43:30.976
It makes sense.

43:30.977 --> 43:31.977
It makes sense.

43:33.937 --> 43:34.976
Single-track mind.

43:34.977 --> 43:35.977
Have another piece of meat.

43:37.617 --> 43:43.097
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:45.057 --> 43:50.017
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:52.457 --> 43:58.537
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:58.857 --> 44:04.217
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

44:07.177 --> 44:12.577
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

44:14.537 --> 44:19.417
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

44:21.977 --> 44:28.177
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

44:28.497 --> 44:34.697
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

44:36.777 --> 44:43.216
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:43.217 --> 44:49.977
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:51.377 --> 44:53.416
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:53.417 --> 44:57.817
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:58.057 --> 45:05.257
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

45:10.057 --> 45:15.217
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:17.377 --> 45:22.737
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:24.777 --> 45:31.176
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:31.177 --> 45:38.097
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:39.537 --> 45:45.777
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:46.017 --> 45:52.937
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:54.217 --> 45:56.176
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:56.177 --> 46:00.776
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

46:00.777 --> 46:07.777
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:08.137 --> 46:15.097
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
